'=>'小寫英文字母、數字、連字號與底線。其他分頁會指向這個別名。留空的話會自動產生。','Make default'=>'設為預設','Manage templates'=>'管理範本','Match'=>'比對方式','Match by email'=>'以 Email 比對','Matching by email means anyone who controls a LINE account with that address can sign in as the matching WordPress user. Leave it off unless you know every LINE email on your site is verified and trusted.'=>'以 Email 比對代表任何人只要握有使用該信箱的 LINE 帳號，就能登入成對應的 WordPress 使用者。除非你確定站上每個 LINE Email 都已驗證且可信，否則請保持關閉。','Maximum reply length'=>'回覆長度上限','Media URLs must use HTTPS.'=>'媒體網址必須使用 HTTPS。','Menu'=>'選單','Menu images must be %1$s or %2$s pixels, JPEG or PNG, and at most 1 MB.'=>'選單圖片必須是 %1$s 或 %2$s 像素，JPEG 或 PNG，且不超過 1 MB。','Message'=>'訊息','Message %d is missing its type.'=>'第 %d 則訊息沒有 type。','Message JSON'=>'訊息 JSON','Message quota this month'=>'本月訊息額度','Message the customer in LINE when their order status changes'=>'訂單狀態變更時，用 LINE 通知客人','Message the customer sends'=>'客人會送出的訊息','Messaging API'=>'Messaging API','Messaging API Channel ID'=>'Messaging API Channel ID','Messaging API Channel ID and Channel Secret are required to issue a token.'=>'要簽發 Token 必須先填入 Messaging API 的 Channel ID 與 Channel Secret。','Messaging API channel connected'=>'已連接 Messaging API 頻道','Messaging is not available right now.'=>'目前無法使用訊息功能。','Minimum height'=>'最小高度','Moksa LINE Suite is installed but not connected to a LINE channel yet.'=>'Moksa LINE Suite 已安裝，但還沒連接任何 LINE 頻道。','Move down'=>'往下移','Move left'=>'往左移','Move right'=>'往右移','Move up'=>'往上移','Must be HTTPS, JPEG or PNG, and at most 10 MB.'=>'必須是 HTTPS，JPEG 或 PNG，且不超過 10 MB。','Must match both your LINE Pay merchant currency and the WooCommerce store currency, or the gateway hides itself at checkout.'=>'必須同時符合 LINE Pay 商家幣別和 WooCommerce 商店幣別，否則結帳頁不會顯示這個金流。','My Account tab'=>'我的帳戶分頁','Name'=>'名稱','Name, LINE id or email'=>'名稱、LINE ID 或 Email','Never expires, so treat it like a password. Rotate the channel if it leaks.'=>'永不過期，請當成密碼看待。一旦外洩請更換頻道。','Never settled'=>'從未確認結果','New card'=>'新卡片','New flow'=>'新增流程','New menu'=>'新增選單','New rule'=>'新增規則','New template'=>'新增範本','New visitors'=>'新訪客','No LIFF ID has been configured yet.'=>'還沒有設定 LIFF ID。','No LINE account is linked. Only this user can link their own.'=>'沒有連結任何 LINE 帳號。只有這位使用者本人能連結自己的帳號。','No LINE users recorded yet.'=>'還沒有記錄到任何 LINE 使用者。','No cards yet. Add the first one below.'=>'還沒有卡片，請從下方新增第一張。','No channel access token is configured. Add one under LINE > Settings > Messaging API.'=>'還沒有設定 Channel Access Token。請到 LINE > 設定 > Messaging API 填入。','No conversations yet.'=>'還沒有對話。','No friends have been recorded on this site yet.'=>'這個站台還沒有記錄到任何好友。','No messages yet. Only messages received after this plugin was installed appear here -- LINE does not provide access to earlier chat history.'=>'還沒有訊息。這裡只會出現外掛安裝之後收到的訊息，LINE 並沒有提供更早的聊天記錄。','No notification templates yet.'=>'還沒有任何通知範本。','No other menus in this tab group yet'=>'這個分頁群組還沒有其他選單','No payments yet.'=>'還沒有任何收款。','No problem, that has been cancelled.'=>'好的，已經幫您取消了。','No questions yet. Add the first one below.'=>'還沒有問題，請從下方新增第一題。','No rich menus yet.'=>'還沒有任何圖文選單。','No rules yet.'=>'還沒有任何規則。','No such transaction exists.'=>'找不到這筆交易。','None'=>'無','None yet.'=>'還沒有。','Not available on this server'=>'這台主機不支援','Not linked'=>'未連結','Notable events'=>'值得注意的事件','Nothing logged.'=>'沒有任何紀錄。','Nothing matches this filter. Set it to Everything to see the rest.'=>'沒有符合這個篩選的項目。切換成「全部」就能看到其餘的。','Nothing sent yet.'=>'還沒有送出任何訊息。','Nothing submitted yet.'=>'還沒有任何回覆。','Nothing to reply with yet.'=>'還沒有可以回覆的內容。','Nothing to send yet.'=>'還沒有可以送出的內容。','Nothing yet. If you have already pressed Verify in the LINE Console and this is still empty, the signature check is rejecting deliveries, which almost always means the Messaging API channel secret is wrong.'=>'還沒有任何事件。如果你已經在 LINE Console 按過 Verify 這裡還是空的，代表簽章檢查拒絕了送來的請求，幾乎都是 Messaging API 的 Channel Secret 填錯了。','Notification templates'=>'通知範本','Notify on'=>'通知時機','Number of items'=>'商品件數','Off'=>'關閉','Offer LINE Pay at checkout'=>'在結帳頁