ng API channel to also validate against LINE.'=>'已通過本機檢查。連接 Messaging API 頻道後還可以再交給 LINE 驗證一次。','Paste the webhook URL into the Console, enable "Use webhook", then press Verify.'=>'把 Webhook URL 貼到 Console，開啟「Use webhook」，然後按 Verify。','Paste this into the LINE Login channel as a Callback URL. It must match exactly, including https and any trailing path.'=>'把這個貼到 LINE Login 頻道的 Callback URL。必須完全一致，包含 https 和後面的路徑。','Paste this into the Messaging API channel, turn on "Use webhook", then press Verify.'=>'把這個貼到 Messaging API 頻道，開啟「Use webhook」，然後按 Verify。','Pay Channel ID'=>'Pay Channel ID','Pay Channel secret'=>'Pay Channel Secret','Pay with LINE Pay'=>'使用 LINE Pay 付款','Pay with LINE Pay, LINE Points or a registered card.'=>'可使用 LINE Pay、LINE Points 或已綁定的信用卡付款。','Payment LIFF ID'=>'付款用 LIFF ID','Payment link created.'=>'收款連結已建立。','Payment method'=>'付款方式','Payment received: %1$s %2$s (order %3$s). Thank you!'=>'已收到款項：%1$s %2$s（訂單 %3$s）。謝謝您！','Payment request'=>'收款請求','Payment request: %1$s %2$s'=>'收款請求：%1$s %2$s','Payments'=>'收款','Pickup store address'=>'取貨門市地址','Pickup store name'=>'取貨門市名稱','Pixels. 0 gives square corners.'=>'像素。填 0 就是直角。','Pixels. 0 lets the padding decide.'=>'像素。填 0 就交由內距決定。','Please choose an option:'=>'請選擇一個項目：','Please choose one of: %s'=>'請從這些選項中選一個：%s','Please reply with a date, for example 2026-03-15.'=>'請回覆日期，例如 2026-03-15。','Please reply with a number.'=>'請回覆數字。','Please reply with your answer.'=>'請直接回覆您的答案。','Plugin log'=>'外掛紀錄','Plus the Flex card "%s", drawn below this message.'=>'另外還會附上 Flex 卡片「%s」，顯示在這則訊息下方。','Postback'=>'Postback','Postback data'=>'Postback 資料','Preview'=>'預覽','Priority'=>'優先順序','Profile sync'=>'個人資料同步','Provider status'=>'服務狀態','Publish'=>'發布','Publish "%s"'=>'發布「%s」','Publish a whole tab group'=>'發布整個分頁群組','Publish this menu to LINE before making it the default.'=>'請先把這個選單發布到 LINE，才能設為預設。','Published'=>'發布狀態','Published %d menu to LINE.'=>'已發布 %d 個選單到 LINE。','Published to LINE.'=>'已發布到 LINE。','Publishes every menu in the group in order and repoints their aliases, so the tabs stay consistent with each other.'=>'會依序發布群組裡的每個選單並重新指向它們的別名，讓分頁彼此保持一致。','Publishing to LINE...'=>'正在發布到 LINE…','Question %1$d has %2$d buttons. LINE allows 13 including the Cancel button, so only the first %3$d are sent.'=>'第 %1$d 題有 %2$d 個按鈕。LINE 上限是 13 個（含「取消」），所以只會送出前 %3$d 個。','Question %d has nothing to ask.'=>'第 %d 題沒有填要問什麼。','Question %d offers buttons but none are listed.'=>'第 %d 題設定成按鈕選項，但一個選項都沒填。','Questions'=>'問題','Questions %1$d and %2$d both store their answer as "%3$s", so the second overwrites the first.'=>'第 %1$d 題和第 %2$d 題都存成「%3$s」，後面那題會覆蓋前面那題的答案。','Quick reply set'=>'快速回覆組合','Quick reply set deleted.'=>'快速回覆組合已刪除。','Quick reply set saved.'=>'快速回覆組合已儲存。','Raw message JSON'=>'原始訊息 JSON','Received'=>'收到時間','Recent webhook events'=>'最近的 Webhook 事件','Recipient'=>'收件者','Record conversations and allow replying from WordPress'=>'記錄對話，並允許從 WordPress 回覆','Reference'=>'參考編號','Remove'=>'移除','Remove this card?'=>'要移除這張卡片嗎？','Remove this question?'=>'要移除這個問題嗎？','Replace the current areas with this layout?'=>'要用這個版面取代目前的區塊嗎？','Replies are sent as push messages, which are billed against your channel quota.'=>'回覆是以推播訊息送出的，會計入頻道額度。','Replies to an inbound message are free. Push, multicast and broadcast are billed.'=>'回覆客人來訊是免費的；推播、群播與群發則會計費。','Reply'=>'回覆','Reply with'=>'回覆內容','Request the email scope (needs approval from LINE first)'=>'要求 email scope（需先取得 LINE 核准）','Result'=>'結果','Rich menu deleted.'=>'圖文選單已刪除。','Rich menu image'=>'圖文選單圖片','Rich menu images must be 1 MB or smaller.'=>'圖文選單圖片必須小於或等於 1 MB。','Rich menu images must be JPEG or PNG.'=>'圖文選單圖片必須是 JPEG 或 PNG。','Rich menus'=>'圖文選單','Role for new accounts'=>'新帳號的角色','Rule deleted.'=>'規則已刪除。','Rule saved.'=>'規則已儲存。','Rules are checked in order of match strength first (exact, then prefix, then pattern, then partial, then catch-all) and priority second, so a lower priority number wins between rules of equal strength.'=>'規則先比對強度（完全相符、開頭、比對式、包含、萬用），再比優先順序，所以強度相同時，數字較小的優先順序會勝出。','Sandbox'=>'沙盒','Sandbox mode is on, so no real money moves. Turn it off when you go live.'=>'目前是沙盒模式，不會有實際金流。正式上線前請關閉。','Save'=>'儲存','Save flow'=>'儲存流程','Save rule'=>'儲存規則','Save template'=>'儲存範本','Save to update the preview.'=>'儲存後預覽才會更新。','Saved flows'=>'已儲存的流程','Saved templates'=>'已儲存的範本','Saved.'=>'已儲存。','Saved. Publish it to push the change to LINE.'=>'已儲存。要把變更推送到 LINE，請按發布。','Search'=>'搜尋','Search LINE users'=>'搜尋 LINE 使用者','Search conversations'=>'搜尋對話','Search name or message'=>'搜尋名稱或訊息','Search notifications'=>'搜尋通知','Seconds. Useful when another plugin adjusts the order right after the status changes. 0 sends immediately.'=>'秒。當有別的外掛會在狀態變更後立刻調整訂單時很有用。填 0 就立即送出。','Send'=>'送出','Send a message'=>'送出一則訊息','Send a test to'=>'發送測試給','Send again'=>'重新發送','Send it to (optional)'=>'傳送給（選填）','Send test'=>'發送測試','Send this notification to the customer again?'=>'要再發送一次這則通知給客人嗎？','Send to'=>'發送對象','Send us a message and we will reply in your LINE chat.'=>'傳訊息給我們，我們會在你的 LINE 聊天室回覆。','Sending...'=>'傳送中…','Sent (30 days)'=>'近 30 天已送出','Sent again. The result is in the list below.'=>'已重新發送，結果在下方列表。','Sent to %d people.'=>'已送出給 %d 個人。','Sent when someone adds the account. You can use {display_name}, {site_name} and {site_url}.'=>'有人加入好友時送出。可以使用 {display_name}、{site_name} 和 {site_url}。','Sent, using order %s for the values.'=>'已送出，變數取自訂單 %s。','Sent.'=>'已送出。','Sent. Check the chat on your phone.'=>'已送出，請在手機的聊天室確認。','Sent. We will reply in your LINE chat.'=>'已送出，我們會在 LINE 對話中回覆您。','Set the official account basic ID in the LINE settings first.'=>'請先到 LINE 設定裡填入官方帳號的基本 ID。','Settings'=>'設定','Settings saved.'=>'設定已儲存。','Setup'=>'設定進度','Shipping address'=>'收件地址','Shipping city'=>'收件城市','Shipping method'=>'配送方式','Shipping name'=>'收件人姓名','Shipping, fees and tax'=>'運費、手續費與稅金','Short-lived tokens last 15 minutes, are unlimited in number, and never need storing. A long-lived token never expires, which means a leak is unrecoverable without rotating the channel.'=>'短效 Token 有效 15 分鐘、數量不限、完全不需要儲存。長效 Token 永不過期，也就是說一旦外洩，除了更換頻道之外沒有補救辦法。','Shortcodes'=>'短代碼','Show an option to add as a friend'=>'顯示加入好友的選項','Show the add-friend step prominently'=>'明顯地顯示加入好友的步驟','Show which entries'=>'要顯示哪些項目','Shown in the chat list and in push notifications, where the bubble cannot be drawn.'=>'顯示在聊天列表和推播通知，那些地方畫不出卡片。','Sign in with LINE'=>'用 LINE 登入','Size'=>'尺寸','Source'=>'來源','Start a conversation flow'=>'啟動對話流程','Start from'=>'從這個開始','Start from a layout:'=>'從版面開始：','Start when a message'=>'當訊息符合以下條件時啟動','Status'=>'狀態','Status name, translated'=>'狀態名稱（已翻譯）','Status slug'=>'狀態代碼','Statuses'=>'狀態','Step %d has no question to ask.'=>'第 %d 步沒有填要問什麼。','Stops the AI answering after this many replies in a day. Set to 0 for no limit -- but every reply costs money.'=>'一天回覆達到這個數量後就停止。填 0 代表不限制，但每則回覆都是要付費的。','Stored as'=>'存成欄位','Stored encrypted. Only the last four characters are ever shown again.'=>'加密儲存。之後只會再顯示最後四碼。','Submissions'=>'回覆記錄','Subtotal, formatted'=>'小計（已格式化）','Sure -- I have passed this to a member of our team. They will reply here shortly.'=>'好的，我已經把訊息轉給同事，他們很快會在這裡回覆你。','Switch to another tab'=>'切換到其他分頁','Tab group'=>'分頁群組','Tab order'=>'分頁排序','Tab to switch to'=>'要切換到的分頁','Take over'=>'接手處理','Take payments through LINE Pay. Credentials are configured under LINE > Settings > LINE Pay.'=>'透過 LINE Pay 收款。憑證請在 LINE > 設定 > LINE Pay 裡設定。','Take the money as soon as the customer confirms'=>'客人確認後立刻扣款','Taken over by a person'=>'已由真人接手','Tappable areas'=>'可點擊區塊','Tappable areas as JSON'=>'可點擊區塊的 JSON','Template'=>'範本','Template deleted.'=>'範本已刪除。','Template name'=>'範本名稱','Template saved.'=>'範本已儲存。','Templates'=>'範本','Test sent.'=>'測試訊息已送出。','Text'=>'文字','Text colour'=>'文字顏色','Text under it'=>'標題下方的文字','Thank you {display_name}, we have your request and will confirm shortly.'=>'謝謝你 {display_name}，我們已經收到你的需求，很快會跟你確認。','Thank you, we have received your details.'=>'謝謝您，我們已經收到您的資料。','That JSON cannot be read, so the questions below are not showing it.'=>'這段 JSON 讀不出來，下方的問題卡片沒有反映它。','That change is not valid.'=>'這項變更無效。','That conversation no longer exists.'=>'這則對話已經不存在了。','That did not send. Please try again.'=>'沒有送出成功，請再試一次。','That did not work.'=>'沒有成功。','That does not look like a phone number. Please try again.'=>'這看起來不像電話號碼，請再回覆一次。','That does not look like an email address. Please try again.'=>'這看起來不像 Email，請再回覆一次。','That is a lot of messages at once. Please wait a moment.'=>'一次送出的訊息太多了，請稍等一下。','That is not valid JSON.'=>'這不是有效的 JSON。','That is not valid JSON: %s'=>'這不是有效的 JSON：%s','That looked empty. Please try again.'=>'內容是空的，請再回覆一次。','That notification address is not valid.'=>'這個通知信箱格式不正確。','That order could not be found.'=>'找不到這張訂單。','That order no longer exists.'=>'這張訂單已經不存在了。','That pattern is not valid.'=>'這個比對式無效。','That payment could not be found.'=>'找不到這筆付款。','That rich menu no longer exists.'=>'這個圖文選單已經不存在了。','That row does not name an order and a status to resend.'=>'這一列沒有指明要重送哪張訂單、哪個狀態。','That template could not be loaded.'=>'無法載入這個範本。','That template no longer exists.'=>'這個範本已經不存在了。','That transaction id does not belong to this merchant.'=>'這個交易 ID 不屬於這個商店。','The %1$s section must contain one of: %2$s.'=>'%1$s 區段必須包含下列其中之一：%2$s。','The AI returned an empty answer.'=>'AI 回傳了空白的答案。','The Channel ID, Channel Secret and sandbox switch live on the <a href="%s">LINE Pay settings screen</a>, so they are stored encrypted and shared with payment links.'=>'Channel ID、Channel Secret 與沙盒開關都在 <a href="%s">LINE Pay 設定頁</a>，會加密儲存，並與收款連結共用。','The account to link to no longer exists.'=>'要連結的帳號已經不存在了。','The amount is not valid for this currency.'=>'這個金額不符合該幣別的規則。','The bot cannot send or receive anything until this is set.'=>'沒有設定這個，機器人無法收發任何訊息。','The bot id from AI Engine.'=>'AI Engine 裡的 bot id。','The box at %s needs a contents array.'=>'%s 的 box 必須有 contents 陣列。','The box at %s needs a layout.'=>'%s 的 box 必須設定 layout。','The chat bar text is drawn by LINE below the menu, not on your image. This preview shows layout only, not exact fonts or corners.'=>'聊天列文字是 LINE 畫在選單下方的，不在你的圖片上。這個預覽只呈現版面，字體和圓角不會完全一樣。','The customer cancelled the LINE Pay payment.'=>'客人取消了這筆 LINE Pay 付款。','The customer has insufficient balance.'=>'客人的餘額不足。','The customer has not completed authentication.'=>'客人尚未完成驗證。','The customer is messaged when the order enters any of these statuses. Each notification is billed as a push message.'=>'訂單進入這些狀態的任何一個時，就會發訊息給客人。每則通知都會以推播訊息計費。','The customer sends the trigger, the bot answers. Placeholders are filled in with sample values so you can see the sentence they actually read.'=>'客人送出觸發文字，機器人回覆。變數會帶入範例值，讓你看到客人實際讀到的句子。','The filler component was removed by LINE. Use a box with margin, padding or offset instead.'=>'filler 元件已被 LINE 移除，請改用帶有 margin、padding 或 offset 的 box。','The flow definition is not valid JSON.'=>'流程定義不是有效的 JSON。','The image is larger than 1 MB, which LINE will reject.'=>'圖片超過 1 MB，LINE 會拒絕。','The inbox is switched off under LINE > Settings > Messaging API.'=>'收件匣在 LINE > 設定 > Messaging API 裡被關閉了。','The link was created, but LINE would not deliver it: %s'=>'連結已建立，但 LINE 沒有把它送出：%s','The login response came from an unexpected issuer.'=>'登入回應來自非預期的簽發者。','The login response did not identify a user.'=>'登入回應中沒有識別到使用者。','The login response did not match this login attempt.'=>'登入回應與這次的登入請求不符。','The login response has expired. Please try again.'=>'登入回應已過期，請再試一次。','The login response was issued for a different channel.'=>'登入回應是簽發給另一個頻道的。','The message contains this'=>'訊息包含這段文字','The message is not valid JSON, so this notification will not send: %s'=>'訊息不是有效的 JSON，這則通知不會送出：%s','The message matches this pattern'=>'訊息符合這個比對式','The message starts with this'=>'訊息以這段文字開頭','The payment account status does not allow this operation.'=>'付款帳戶目前的狀態不允許這項操作。','The payment could not be recorded.'=>'這筆付款無法記錄。','The payment could not be started. Please try again.'=>'無法開始付款流程，請再試一次。','The payment request could not be encoded.'=>'付款請求無法編碼。','The payment was cancelled.'=>'付款已取消。','The preview is an approximation. Use "Check" to validate against LINE itself, and "Send test" to see the real thing in a chat.'=>'預覽只是近似的樣子。用「檢查」交給 LINE 驗證，用「發送測試」在聊天室裡看真正的效果。','The questions as JSON'=>'問題的 JSON','The recorded list only includes people this site has seen since the webhook was switched on, so it is usually smaller than the real follower count.'=>'本站記錄的名單只包含 Webhook 開啟之後出現過的人，所以通常會比實際好友數少。','The request headers were not accepted. Check the Channel Secret.'=>'請求標頭未被接受，請檢查 Channel Secret。','The rich menu could not be saved.'=>'圖文選單儲存失敗。','The selected image could not be read from disk.'=>'無法從磁碟讀取所選的圖片。','The selected image could not be read from the media library.'=>'無法從媒體庫讀取所選的圖片。','The statuses above use a built-in card. For full control -- your own Flex design, and conditions such as payment or shipping method -- create <a href="%s">notification templates</a>. When a template matches, it replaces the built-in card.'=>'上面的狀態使用內建卡片。若要完全掌控（自己的 Flex 設計，以及付款或配送方式之類的條件），請建立<a href="%s">通知範本</a>。範本符合條件時，會取代內建卡片。','The tappable areas could not be read.'=>'無法讀取可點擊區塊的設定。','The template could not be saved.'=>'範本儲存失敗。','The whole conversation, from the trigger to the last answer. Buttons are drawn where LINE puts them, under the message.'=>'從觸發到最後一個答案的完整對話。按鈕畫在 LINE 實際擺放的位置，也就是訊息下方。','The whole message is exactly this'=>'整則訊息剛好等於這段文字','Their answer'=>'客人的回答','There are no orders yet to build a preview from.'=>'還沒有訂單可以用來產生預覽。','There is nothing to send.'=>'沒有可以送出的內容。','These cover the common card. Anything else -- extra rows, colours, more buttons -- is edited in the JSON.'=>'這幾欄涵蓋最常見的卡片。其他的（多幾列、顏色、更多按鈕）請在 JSON 裡編輯。','This LINE account is already linked to another user on this site.'=>'這個 LINE 帳號已經連結到本站的另一位使用者。','This bubble exceeds the 30 KB limit.'=>'這個 bubble 超過 30 KB 上限。','This card has a layout these fields cannot describe, so it is edited as JSON below. Nothing here will change it.'=>'這張卡片的版面不是這幾個欄位能描述的，請用下方的 JSON 編輯。這裡的欄位不會更動它。','This carousel exceeds the 50 KB limit. Remove bubbles or shorten the content.'=>'這組輪播超過 50 KB 上限，請減少 bubble 或縮短內容。','This does not look like a channel ID: %s. A LINE channel ID is a number, usually ten digits. If your browser filled this in for you, clear it and paste the value from the LINE Developers Console.'=>'這看起來不像 Channel ID：%s。LINE 的 Channel ID 是數字，通常十位數。如果是瀏覽器自動填入的，請清空後從 LINE Developers Console 貼上正確的值。','This layout nests too deeply.'=>'這個版面巢狀層數過深。','This link expired. Please go back and try again.'=>'這個連結已過期，請返回後再試一次。','This login could not be verified. Please try again.'=>'這次登入無法通過驗證，請再試一次。','This login link has expired. Please try again.'=>'這個登入連結已過期，請再試一次。','This login request is missing its state. Please start again.'=>'這次的登入請求缺少 state，請重新開始。','This menu is now the default for everyone.'=>'這個選單現在是所有人的預設選單。','This merchant cannot use LINE Pay right now. Contact LINE Pay support.'=>'這個商店目前無法使用 LINE Pay，請聯絡 LINE Pay 客服。','This merchant is not registered with LINE Pay. Check the Channel ID and whether you are pointed at sandbox or production.'=>'這個商店代號沒有在 LINE Pay 註冊。請檢查 Channel ID，以及目前是指向沙盒還是正式環境。','This message is not a card or a carousel, so it can only be edited as JSON.'=>'這則訊息不是卡片也不是輪播，只能用 JSON 編輯。','This order has no LINE Pay transaction to refund.'=>'這張訂單沒有可退款的 LINE Pay 交易。','This order has nothing to pay.'=>'這張訂單沒有需要付款的金額。','This page could not identify you. Reopen it from LINE.'=>'這個頁面無法辨識你的身分，請從 LINE 重新開啟。','This payment has already been captured.'=>'這筆付款已經請款完成。','This payment has already been refunded, or the refund window has closed.'=>'這筆付款已經退款，或是已超過可退款期限。','This payment is already being confirmed. Please wait a moment and refresh.'=>'這筆付款正在確認中，請稍候後重新整理。','This payment is already being processed.'=>'這筆付款正在處理中。','This rich menu has no tappable areas yet.'=>'這個圖文選單還沒有設定任何可點擊區塊。','This screen is missing.'=>'找不到這個畫面。','This session belongs to a different channel.'=>'這次的連線屬於另一個頻道。','This session could not be verified. Reopen the page from LINE.'=>'這次的連線無法驗證，請從 LINE 重新開啟頁面。','This site is not accepting new registrations through LINE. Please sign in with your existing account first, then link LINE from your profile.'=>'這個站台沒有開放用 LINE 註冊新帳號。請先用既有帳號登入，再從個人資料頁連結 LINE。','This template did not produce a valid message. Check the JSON and the placeholders.'=>'這個範本沒有產生有效的訊息，請檢查 JSON 和變數。','This template will not send as it stands.'=>'這個範本目前的狀態無法送出。','Time'=>'時間','Title'=>'標題','To build tabs, give several menus the same tab group and point their tab buttons at each other with a "switch tab" action.'=>'要做分頁，把幾個選單設成同一個分頁群組，再用「切換分頁」動作讓它們的分頁按鈕互指。','Total'=>'合計','Tracking number, from ECPay, RY Tools, AST or Shipment Tracking'=>'物流單號，來自綠界、RY Tools、AST 或 Shipment Tracking','Tracking numbers are read from ECPay, RY Tools, Advanced Shipment Tracking and WooCommerce Shipment Tracking. After the last attempt the notification is sent anyway, without the number.'=>'物流單號會從綠界、RY Tools、Advanced Shipment Tracking 和 WooCommerce Shipment Tracking 讀取。試到最後一次仍然沒有的話，通知還是會送出，只是不含單號。','Tracking wait'=>'等待設定','Transaction'=>'交易編號','Trigger'=>'觸發','Trigger text'=>'觸發文字','Turn them on'=>'開啟通知','Type'=>'類型','Type SEND in the confirmation box to go ahead.'=>'請在確認欄位輸入 SEND 才會送出。','Type SEND to confirm'=>'輸入 SEND 以確認','Type your message'=>'輸入你的訊息','Unlink'=>'解除連結','Unlink LINE account'=>'解除 LINE 帳號連結','Unlink your LINE account?'=>'要解除 LINE 帳號連結嗎？','Use a long-lived token I paste below'=>'使用我在下方貼上的長效 Token','Use as the default menu for everyone'=>'設為所有人的預設選單','Use the sandbox environment (no real money moves)'=>'使用沙盒環境（不會有實際金流）','Used by the LIFF shortcodes unless one is given explicitly.'=>'LIFF 短代碼在沒有另外指定時會使用這個。','Uses the most recent order to fill in the values. Save first.'=>'會用最近一筆訂單的資料填入變數。請先儲存。','View order'=>'查看訂單','Visitor'=>'訪客','Wait for tracking'=>'等待物流單號','Waiting for the customer to complete payment on LINE Pay.'=>'等待客人在 LINE Pay 完成付款。','Warnings and errors'=>'警告與錯誤','Warnings only'=>'只看警告','Webhook URL'=>'Webhook URL','Webhook has received an event'=>'Webhook 已收到過事件','Webhook signatures are verified with this. Without it, nothing the bot receives can be trusted.'=>'Webhook 的簽章是用這個驗證的。沒有它，機器人收到的任何東西都不可信。','Webhook signing secret is the Messaging API one'=>'Webhook 簽章用的是 Messaging API 的密鑰','Webhooks are signed with the Messaging API channel secret. Falling back to the Login channel secret only works when both channels are the same, which is unusual.'=>'Webhook 是用 Messaging API 的 Channel Secret 簽章的。退而使用 Login 頻道的密鑰只有在兩個頻道相同時才會成功，而那並不常見。','What every recipient gets. A broadcast is billed per person and cannot be recalled, so this is the last look you have.'=>'每位收件者會看到的樣子。群發按人數計費且無法收回，這是你最後一次確認的機會。','What is this for'=>'這筆款項的名目','What name should we put this under?'=>'請問怎麼稱呼？','What the bot asks'=>'機器人問什麼','What the customer sees at checkout.'=>'客人在結帳頁會看到的名稱。','When'=>'時間','When a message contains this, the bot stops answering and the conversation is flagged for a human.'=>'訊息包含這個關鍵字時，機器人就停止回覆，並把對話標記為需要真人處理。','When tapped'=>'點擊時','When they finish, say'=>'完成後說','When to send'=>'什麼時候發送','Where to send people after login. Leave blank to return them to the page they came from.'=>'登入後要把人導到哪裡。留空就會回到他們原本的頁面。','Which area of the plugin'=>'外掛的哪個區塊','Which conversations to show'=>'要顯示哪些對話','Which date would you like?'=>'想預約哪一天？','Which results to show'=>'要顯示哪些結果','Which service?'=>'想預約哪個服務？','Whichever chatbot you have set up in AI Engine, including its knowledge base.'=>'你在 AI Engine 裡設定的聊天機器人，包含它的知識庫。','Who'=>'對象','Width'=>'寬度','With immediate capture off, payments are only authorised. You then have to capture or void each one, and an order cancelled in WooCommerce releases its authorisation automatically.'=>'關閉立即請款時，付款只會被授權。之後你必須自己請款或作廢，而在 WooCommerce 取消訂單會自動釋放該筆授權。','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','WooCommerce is not active, so there is nothing to notify about.'=>'WooCommerce 沒有啟用，因此沒有可以通知的內容。','WooCommerce is not active.'=>'WooCommerce 沒有啟用。','WordPress account'=>'WordPress 帳號','Working...'=>'處理中…','Write a message or choose a template first.'=>'請先輸入訊息內容或選擇一個範本。','Write a reply'=>'輸入回覆內容','Write something first.'=>'請先輸入內容。','You are not signed in.'=>'你尚未登入。','You can use {display_name}, {site_name} and {site_url}.'=>'可以使用 {display_name}、{site_name} 和 {site_url}。','You cannot change conversations.'=>'你沒有權限變更對話。','You cannot clear the log.'=>'你沒有權限清除紀錄。','You cannot create payment links.'=>'你沒有權限建立收款連結。','You cannot read conversations.'=>'你沒有權限檢視對話。','You cannot reply to conversations.'=>'你沒有權限回覆對話。','You cannot resend notifications.'=>'你沒有權限重新發送通知。','You cannot send broadcasts.'=>'你沒有權限群發訊息。','You cannot send test notifications.'=>'你沒有權限發送測試通知。','You cannot unlink another user.'=>'你不能解除其他使用者的連結。','You do not have permission to change bot settings.'=>'你沒有權限變更機器人設定。','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'你沒有權限變更這些設定。','You do not have permission to manage rich menus.'=>'你沒有權限管理圖文選單。','You do not have permission to manage templates.'=>'你沒有權限管理範本。','You do not have permission to view this page.'=>'你沒有權限檢視這個頁面。','Your LINE account is linked. Order updates will be sent to you on LINE.'=>'你的 LINE 帳號已連結，訂單更新會透過 LINE 通知你。','Your message'=>'你的訊息','Your official account'=>'你的官方帳號','[%1$s] New LINE submission: %2$s'=>'[%1$s] 新的 LINE 表單回覆：%2$s','[Audio]'=>'[語音]','[File]'=>'[檔案]','[Flex]'=>'[Flex]','[Image]'=>'[圖片]','[Sticker]'=>'[貼圖]','[Video]'=>'[影片]','a link to your official account'=>'連到你官方帳號的連結','a message box that posts into the inbox'=>'一個把訊息送進收件匣的輸入框','altText is limited to 1500 characters.'=>'altText 上限為 1500 字。','check every'=>'每隔','contains this'=>'包含這段文字','contents must be a bubble or a carousel.'=>'contents 必須是 bubble 或 carousel。','default'=>'預設','e.g. cod, flat_rate, 1000'=>'例如 cod、flat_rate、1000','equals'=>'等於','greets the visitor by their LINE name'=>'用訪客的 LINE 名稱打招呼','is'=>'等於','is at least'=>'大於或等於','is at most'=>'小於或等於','is exactly this'=>'完全等於這段文字','is less than'=>'小於','is more than'=>'大於','is not'=>'不等於','never fires'=>'永遠不會觸發','no'=>'否','no detail given'=>'沒有提供詳細說明','not published'=>'尚未發布','off'=>'已停用','refunded %s'=>'已退款 %s','seconds,'=>'秒檢查一次，','the sign-in button'=>'登入按鈕','times'=>'次','up to'=>'最多','yes'=>'是','list separator, '=>'、','sample customer name shown in previewsMing'=>'小明']];